      "created_at": "2017-02-04T09:06:44Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-02-04T09:06:44Z",
      "body": "probably all users will have read and closed the cookie warning - so in fact, not deleting the ones who have closed it will be almost the same as not deleting any - the table will still be full.\r\n\r\nIf they close the the box, they have accepted the principle of cookies - would leaving a cookie when cookies have been accepted be the best way forward ?",
