      "body": "thats curious - that seems to suggest that most people view your site with the cookie warning obscuring much of the page ?\r\nor perhaps the warning is not displayed in many of the browsers ?\r\n\r\nI also suggested implementing the cookie warning as a banner that slides in and out from the top / bottom of the page (as is common on many other sites) so that people who choose not to click accept can continue to browse without the warning obscuring their view",
